    Piano
    Starts: verse
    Starts: low
    Starts: high

Clip verse:
    Arp/48
    Arp/60 | steps=8 gap=3
    Chord/55
    Chord/52 | third=3
    Hit/60 | loud
    Hit/62 | !loud
    Arp as run /36 | steps=2
    Phrase as ph /67 | rise=3
    Note/(ph.top.pitch - 12) | velocity=ph.bottom.velocity

